			"name": "Clerical Investment",
			"reference": "B43",
			"local_notes": "Menkhu (line-knower), not Yargachin (priest) - he has not been cut. Licensed to open bodies and to perform the Kolyarga (the-bog-opening; the lesser rite). Purely social; no miracles. B43",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Social"
			],
			"base_points": 5,
			"features": [
				{
