			"description": "Parrying Buckler",
			"reference": "LT114",
			"local_notes": "Old bronze with an exterior of joined aurochs horns, tapering to rounded points, the central grip its widest part. DB 1 and another +1 to Block on top (LT116). Two pounds against a shield's fifteen — which is the whole reason he stays at No Encumbrance in a swamp.",
